[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3300.15, "timestamp": "00:55:00", "text": "我。是的。所以我仍然后悔，伙计。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3302.39, "timestamp": "00:55:02", "text": "牺牲我自己的社区，并且喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3305.43, "timestamp": "00:55:05", "text": "专注于虚拟主播相关的内容。感觉就像我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3307.549, "timestamp": "00:55:07", "text": "浪费了太多"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3308.637, "timestamp": "00:55:08", "author": "@SuzukiZurikoVTuber", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/852SZLheWUnfQGntgjphW0AD17oXLR9MhuzMLEzOm451wzhCllgmSUMTMpDu7wtBK7HSHR9J=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "people throw u around too much :("}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3312.15, "timestamp": "00:55:12", "text": "年。呃，没关系。至少我很高兴。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3314.95, "timestamp": "00:55:14", "text": "这里有人，人们都很活跃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3318.19, "timestamp": "00:55:18", "text": "有新人加入。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3319.71, "timestamp": "00:55:19", "text": "嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3322.549, "timestamp": "00:55:22", "text": "呃，那里有人，而且他们好像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3325.589, "timestamp": "00:55:25", "text": "他们通过合作，将事物联系起来。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3325.659, "timestamp": "00:55:25", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "you're not wrong but idk i think i have enough people to rely on where i think i can manage comfortably"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3328.23, "timestamp": "00:55:28", "text": "我唯一讨厌的就是这种类型"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3330.79, "timestamp": "00:55:30", "text": "有点像群像或者这种戏剧性的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3333.829, "timestamp": "00:55:33", "text": "人们都在回避虚假新闻。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3336.79, "timestamp": "00:55:36", "text": "比如假戏之类的，还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3340.39, "timestamp": "00:55:40", "text": "守门人、把关人等等。我的意思是，我们不能这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3342.71, "timestamp": "00:55:42", "text": "现在还有什么关于这件事的消息吗？它总是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3345.87, "timestamp": "00:55:45", "text": "发生在一个内部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3355.27, "timestamp": "00:55:55", "text": "是的，它不像动漫那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3358.309, "timestamp": "00:55:58", "text": "想变得像快乐一样无忧无虑。"}]